    "detailed_description": "<strong>A story of sin and 'the girl'.</strong><br><br>You find yourself in a world of monochrome, alone, until you meet Zarie, a girl with white hair, red eyes, and black clothes.<br>She tells you she is a deity of death, this is Hell, and that you are a sinner.<br>Guided by Zaire, you travel to meet Emma, Hell's Judgement, to be tried.<br>What awaits you at the end of this short, yet arduous journey?<br><br>Features<br>\u30fbA short visual novel with minimal text, backgrounds, and CG.<br>\u30fbDynamic story choices change how Zarie answers.<br>\u30fbEnjoy the story's four CGs in &quot;CG Mode&quot;.<br>\u30fbSupports both Japanese and English playback.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A story of sin and 'the girl'.</strong><br><br>You find yourself in a world of monochrome, alone, until you meet Zarie, a girl with white hair, red eyes, and black clothes.<br>She tells you she is a deity of death, this is Hell, and that you are a sinner.<br>Guided by Zaire, you travel to meet Emma, Hell's Judgement, to be tried.<br>What awaits you at the end of this short, yet arduous journey?<br><br>Features<br>\u30fbA short visual novel with minimal text, backgrounds, and CG.<br>\u30fbDynamic story choices change how Zarie answers.<br>\u30fbEnjoy the story's four CGs in &quot;CG Mode&quot;.<br>\u30fbSupports both Japanese and English playback.",
